","settings":{"heading":"ENVÍO GRATIS en 24-48 Horas","icon":"truck","content":"","page":"envios-y-devoluciones"}},"fe070939-53ac-4687-8912-a7184670f41c":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"1º CAMBIO DE TALLA GRATIS","icon":"shoe","content":"","page":"prueba-de-talla-gratuita"}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"30 DÍAS PARA DEVOLVER TU PEDIDO","icon":"check_mark","content":"","page":"garantia-y-devoluciones"}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Peso","icon":"ruler","content":"<p>295 g. en talla 42<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","e8947d02-fa92-4246-b48d-a3f195a6d928","price","fd949273-b2f6-4529-8809-633f44b37cd2","variant_picker","3a07755d-fb28-473d-b22a-0c1604d85b48","buy_buttons","collapsible_tab_86irkP","9af918ec-40a6-4aa0-aaa1-c0b978a21677","collapsible-row-0","deb1f4b2-1b6e-410e-91a8-4f7f5d036ad8","fe070939-53ac-4687-8912-a7184670f41c","collapsible-row-1","collapsible-row-2"],"settings":{"enable_sticky_info":true,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail_slider","media_size":"large","mobile_thumbnails":"show","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":12}},"1644854849ecf13122":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"16448548492e70806f-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Transpirabilidad y confort en carrera","heading_size":"h1"}},"16448548492e70806f-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Materiales de alta transpirabilidad, que no absorben el agua a la vez que la drenan al exterior. Esto permite que el pie se mantenga en unas condiciones óptimas durante el mayor tiempo posible. <\/p><p>Sus propiedades permiten una eficiente limpieza y mantenimiento, lo que se traduce en una mayor durabilidad.<\/p><p>Lengüeta delgada y embutida para una fácil expulsión del agua.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["16448548492e70806f-0","16448548492e70806f-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/agua.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"16450087239f2017c4":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"1645008723a20d0ba4-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Consigue la máxima amortiguación en tus carreras de montaña","heading_size":"h1"}},"1645008723a20d0ba4-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Zapatilla cómoda, ligera (295g en talla 42) y transpirable que ha sido diseñada para carreras de hasta 30km.<\/p><p>Entresuela de EVA diseñada para ofrecer una gran amortiguación en carrera (Drop 10mm). Además, cuenta con un RockPlate de 1mm de espesor que te protegerá de impactos contra rocas.<\/p><p>Al no absorber el agua o la humedad, permite mantener un peso regular durante toda la carrera independientemente del clima o el terreno.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["1645008723a20d0ba4-0","1645008723a20d0ba4-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/distancia.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"16449183565507ec91":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"16449183564a700b91-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Agarre óptimo en todo tipo de terrenos y obstáculos","heading_size":"h1"}},"16449183564a700b91-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p> Suela ORIOCX con gran amortiguación y que incorpora una placa de protección frente a impactos en su interior (Sólo en el color azul).<\/p><p>Suela con tacos de 4mm que se adapta tanto a terrenos blandos como a terrenos duros.<\/p><p>El diseño de sus tacos está pensado para un eficiente desalojo del barro durante la carrera. <\/p><p>Sistema de canales en la suela que utilizando la flexión de la zapatilla evita que se formen placas de barro.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["16449183564a700b91-0","16449183564a700b91-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/obstaculos.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0}},"164545225962e5ebe1":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"16454522593483423d-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"","heading_size":"h1"}},"16454522593483423d-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Sus tecnologías de agarre unidas a la capacidad de no absorción del agua hacen de Sparta una zapatilla ideal para: Carreras de montaña en zonas húmedas y Carreras de Obstáculos (OCR)<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["16454522593483423d-0","16454522593483423d-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/espartaagua.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"1646077050ee344f72":{"type":"image-banner-2","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/suelaesparta.gif","image_overlay_opacity":0,"image_height":"medium","adapt_height_first_image":true,"desktop_content_position":"middle-center","show_text_box":true,"desktop_content_alignment":"center","color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"center","stack_images_on_mobile":true,"show_text_below":true}},"16449125685dc0fb32":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"1644912568723d30da-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Más de 500 Km. de duración","heading_size":"h1"}},"1644912568723d30da-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>La competencia te dirá que no se pueden hacer zapatillas de trail que conserven sus propiedades de amortiguación y agarre durante muchos kilometros. <\/p><p>En Oriocx invertimos en los mejores materiales del mercado para aumentar la durabilidad de las zapatillas sin sacrificar su agarre; aunque ello nos suponga un mayor coste.<\/p><p>  Los atletas que han probado las Oriocx Sparta las han disfrutado al menos durante 500 km en terrenos de montaña exigentes.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["1644912568723d30da-0","1644912568723d30da-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/duracion.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"16449224846e8fc4f0":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"1644922484ceac350f-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Tecnologías para evitar lesiones y correr cómodamente","heading_size":"h1"}},"1644922484ceac350f-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p><strong>Placa de protección frente a impactos<\/strong> en el interior de la suela (Sólo en el color azul).<\/p><p><strong>Pieza semirrigida de talón<\/strong> para mayor estabilidad y protección frente a impactos.<\/p><p><strong>Media suela de EVA apilada<\/strong> (drop de 10 mm) para una combinación de amortiguación y protección de piedras.<\/p><p><strong>Refuerzo de la caña en la entresuela<\/strong> para ofrecer mayor estabilidad.<\/p><p><strong>Horma ancha<\/strong> para una sensación de carrera confortable; especialmente en las distancias más largas.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["1644922484ceac350f-0","1644922484ceac350f-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/lesiones.gif","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"1645022049748b5cf6":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"16450220495f7d858d-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"","heading_size":"h1"}},"16450220495f7d858d-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Bolsa de cordón en la lengüeta para un ajuste compacto que evite la entrada de suciedad. (Sólo en el color azul).<\/p><p>Práctica plantilla interior extraíble para mayor comodidad y secado más fácil.<\/p><p>Envoltura cosida en la parte delantera para mayor resistencia.<\/p><p>Refuerzo para evitar rasguños.<\/p><p>Parte superior resistente al agua duradera.<\/p><p>Lengüeta delgada embutida para una fácil expulsión del agua<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["16450220495f7d858d-0","16450220495f7d858d-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/lengueta.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"1644942710bc93bdf7":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"1644942710717912c5-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"","heading_size":"h1"}},"1644942710717912c5-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Aptas también para practicar Canicross y Orientación gracias a su horma ancha y a los estabilizadores de la zapatilla, que ofrecen gran estabilidad y protección en carrera.<\/p><p><br\/><br\/><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["1644942710717912c5-0","1644942710717912c5-1"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/canicross.jpg","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"no-overlap","color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"16449410662a7742f8":{"type":"apps","block